WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.931 --> 00:00:06.597
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THE GOVERNMENT

00:00:06.598 --> 00:00:08.165
SHUTDOWN ENDED FOR THE MOMENT,

00:00:08.166 --> 00:00:08.566
TEMPORARILY.

00:00:08.567 --> 00:00:10.034
BUT THE BATTLE OVER A BORDER

00:00:10.035 --> 00:00:10.901
WALL CONTINUES.

00:00:10.902 --> 00:00:12.203
SPEAKER OF THE HOUSE NANCY

00:00:12.204 --> 00:00:13.504
PELOSI VOWED SHE WILL NEVER

00:00:13.505 --> 00:00:15.472
FUND THAT WALL UNDER ANY

00:00:15.473 --> 00:00:15.906
CIRCUMSTANCES.

00:00:15.907 --> 00:00:16.907
THE PRESIDENT PROMISES HE IS

00:00:16.908 --> 00:00:18.008
GOING TO BUILD ONE.

00:00:18.009 --> 00:00:19.543
SO THAT SEEMS TO LEAVE THE

00:00:19.544 --> 00:00:21.278
WHITE HOUSE WITH ONE OPTION.

00:00:21.279 --> 00:00:22.546
DECLARE A NATIONAL EMERGENCY

00:00:22.547 --> 00:00:24.081
AND ORDER THE BUILDING OF A

00:00:24.082 --> 00:00:25.449
WALL ON THE SOUTHERN BORDER.

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:27.017
THAT SOUNDS LIKE A PRETTY

00:00:27.018 --> 00:00:28.686
RADICAL SOLUTION.

00:00:28.687 --> 00:00:30.921
BUT IS IT?

00:00:30.922 --> 00:00:32.256
IT TURNS OUT NATIONAL

00:00:32.257 --> 00:00:33.490
EMERGENCIES HAPPEN ALL THE

00:00:33.491 --> 00:00:34.091
TIME.

00:00:34.092 --> 00:00:35.259
SOMEHOW VERY FEW OF THEM

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:36.727
RECEIVE ANY ATTENTION AT ALL.

00:00:36.728 --> 00:00:38.862
IN 1976, CONGRESS PASSED THE

00:00:38.863 --> 00:00:39.863
NATIONAL EMERGENCIES ACT.

00:00:39.864 --> 00:00:40.931
THAT LAW GRANTS THE PRESIDENT

00:00:40.932 --> 00:00:42.933
THE POWER TO DECLARE A STATE

00:00:42.934 --> 00:00:44.501
OF EMERGENCY IN RESPONSE TO

00:00:44.502 --> 00:00:46.704
VIRTUALLY ANYTHING IF HE

00:00:46.705 --> 00:00:47.605
THINKS IT'S NECESSARY.

00:00:47.606 --> 00:00:50.207
NATIONAL EMERGENCIES CAN BE

00:00:50.208 --> 00:00:52.977
RENEWED ANNUALLY AND ROUTINELY

00:00:52.978 --> 00:00:53.410
ARE.

00:00:53.411 --> 00:00:54.645
CONGRESS CAN ONLY BLOCK THE

00:00:54.646 --> 00:00:56.180
EMERGENCY WITH TWO-THIRD VOTE.

00:00:56.181 --> 00:00:58.449
BROAD LAW AND APPLIED A LOT.

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:00.951
IT BEGAN IN 1979 WHEN

00:01:00.952 --> 00:01:02.319
PRESIDENT JIMMY CARTER

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:03.654
DECLARED NATIONAL EMERGENCY TO

00:01:03.655 --> 00:01:05.289
KEEP THE IRANIAN GOVERNMENT

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:06.090
PROPERTY ENTERING THE UNITED

00:01:06.091 --> 00:01:06.523
STATES.

00:01:06.524 --> 00:01:07.891
THAT EMERGENCY IS STILL

00:01:07.892 --> 00:01:10.661
ONGOING DESPITE BEING OLDER

00:01:10.662 --> 00:01:11.495
THAN ALEXANDRIA OCASIO-CORTEZ

00:01:11.496 --> 00:01:12.229
FOR EXAMPLE.

00:01:12.230 --> 00:01:13.397
SINCE THAT DATE, AMERICAN

00:01:13.398 --> 00:01:16.033
PRESIDENTS DECLARED NO FEWER

00:01:16.034 --> 00:01:21.905
THAN 58 NATIONAL EMERGENCIES.

00:01:21.906 --> 00:01:24.341
31 OF THEM ARE STILL ONGOING.

00:01:24.342 --> 00:01:25.676
THE AVERAGE STATE OF EMERGENCY

00:01:25.677 --> 00:01:26.877
IN THE COUNTRY LASTED NINE AND

00:01:26.878 --> 00:01:27.578
A HALF YEARS.

00:01:27.579 --> 00:01:28.812
WHAT ARE THE ENERGIES?

00:01:28.813 --> 00:01:31.515
SOME REALLY WERE EMERGENCIES.

00:01:31.516 --> 00:01:33.317
SEPTEMBER 2001.

00:01:33.318 --> 00:01:34.518
PRESIDENT BUSH ANNOUNCED STATE

00:01:34.519 --> 00:01:35.886
OF EMERGENCY TO GIVE WHITE

00:01:35.887 --> 00:01:37.388
HOUSE GREATER AUTHORITY TO

00:01:37.389 --> 00:01:39.290
MOBILIZE THE MILITARY, CALL

00:01:39.291 --> 00:01:42.326
THE NATIONAL GUARD AND PERFORM

00:01:42.327 --> 00:01:42.993
COUNTERTERRORIST ACTION.

00:01:42.994 --> 00:01:44.662
IT'S BEEN RENEWED EACH OF THE

00:01:44.663 --> 00:01:46.063
PAST 18 YEARS.

00:01:46.064 --> 00:01:47.531
SO THAT WAS REAL.

00:01:47.532 --> 00:01:49.466
WE ALSO HAD A DECADE LONG

00:01:49.467 --> 00:01:50.668
NATIONAL EMERGENCY TO COMBAT

00:01:50.669 --> 00:01:52.336
THE SWINE FLU.

00:01:52.337 --> 00:01:53.971
PRESIDENT TRUMP DECLARED THREE

00:01:53.972 --> 00:01:55.205
NATIONAL EMERGENCIES ALREADY.

00:01:55.206 --> 00:01:56.607
I BET YOU DIDN'T KNOW THAT.

00:01:56.608 --> 00:01:58.175
ONE OF THEM SANCTIONED THOSE

00:01:58.176 --> 00:01:59.810
WHO USED SOCIAL MEDIA TO

00:01:59.811 --> 00:02:05.349
INFLUENCE ELECTIONS.

00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:10.821
THE DASTARDLY MASS DONIANS --

00:02:10.822 --> 00:02:11.221
MACEDONIANS.

00:02:11.222 --> 00:02:12.389
ANOTHER NATIONAL EMERGENCY

00:02:12.390 --> 00:02:14.758
PUNISHES ANYONE WHO WORKS TO

00:02:14.759 --> 00:02:17.161
"UNDER MINE SOVEREIGNTY OF

00:02:17.162 --> 00:02:18.329
LEBANON.

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:19.596
YOU SEE THE POINT HERE?

00:02:19.597 --> 00:02:21.298
IN WASHINGTON, PROTECTING THE

00:02:21.299 --> 00:02:23.400
SOVEREIGNTY OF THE FAR AWAY

00:02:23.401 --> 00:02:24.401
MIDDLE EASTERN COUNTRY VERY

00:02:24.402 --> 00:02:26.503
FEW AMERICANS WILL EVER GO TO

00:02:26.504 --> 00:02:27.504
QUALIFIES AS A NATIONAL

00:02:27.505 --> 00:02:28.305
EMERGENCY.

00:02:28.306 --> 00:02:30.107
PROTECTING OUR OWN COUNTRY

00:02:30.108 --> 00:02:31.608
SOVEREIGNTY IS, "IMMORAL."

00:02:31.609 --> 00:02:33.043
WE ARE NOT OVERSTATING THAT.

